OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain across western Tayside. Elsewhere
OL,7,Fit will be mainly dry with some
OL,8,Fbrighter spells possible along the
OL,9,Feast coast. Fresh southwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain in the west
OL,12,Fdying out this evening, elsewhere
OL,13,Fhaving a dry end to the day. Then the
OL,14,Frest of the night will be dry.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FA cloudy day with occasional
OL,17,Frain, although this light and patchy
OL,18,Facross the east. Rain turning more
OL,19,Fpersistent across the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
